{domain:0, official:false, fromCourse:true, q:`You need Claude to evaluate whether a part should be made of metal, polymer, ceramic, or composite, weighing many criteria per material. Asking for all four evaluations in one prompt produces shallow, inconsistent answers. What pattern improves this?`, options:[
