{domain:4, official:false, fromCourse:true, q:`After splitting a long report into chunks, retrieval quality drops because individual chunks lose their connection to the surrounding document (e.g., a chunk about "results" doesn't indicate which experiment it refers to). What technique addresses this?`, options:[
